---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: index.html
nav: home
title: SwiftPune — An Apple platforms community in Pune
description: SwiftPune is a Pune-grown community of Apple-platform engineers, designers, and students — iOS, macOS, visionOS, and server-side Swift. Meetups, campus outreach, and community nights.
ogDescription: A Pune-grown community of Apple-platform engineers, designers, and students. Meetups, campus outreach, and community nights.
ogAlt: SwiftPune — an Apple platforms community in Pune
---
{#- Programme cards read from src/_data/{meetups,outreach,casuals,openhour}.js, so
    counts and "latest" dates update when an event is added there. -#}
{%- set programmes = [
  { data: meetups, href: "/meetups" },
  { data: outreach, href: "/student-outreach" },
  { data: casuals, href: "/casuals" },
  { data: openhour, href: "/open-hour" }
] %}
{%- set hosts = meetups.events | reverse %}
{%- set countWord = ["No", "One", "Two", "Three", "Four", "Five", "Six", "Seven", "Eight", "Nine", "Ten"][hosts.length] or hosts.length %}
      <!-- ===========================================================
           Hero — logo centerpiece + tech-coded headline + CTAs
           =========================================================== -->
      <section class="hero" id="top">
        <!-- Soft bubble blob behind the logo (decorative) -->
        <span class="hero__blob hero__blob--accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="hero__blob hero__blob--teal" aria-hidden="true"></span>

        <div class="hero__grid">
          <div class="hero__mark">
            <div class="hero__logo-wrap">
              <img
                class="hero__logo"
                src="assets/SPLogo.png"
                alt="SwiftPune"
                width="680"
                height="680"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero__copy">
            <p class="comment-eyebrow">// Apple-platform devs · Pune · est. 2025</p>
            <h1 class="hero__title">
              An Apple platforms <span class="ink">community</span>.
            </h1>
            <p class="hero__sub">
              A Pune-grown community of Apple-platform engineers, designers,
              and students, meeting to learn together, share what we know, and
              grow the next generation of Apple-platform builders in the city.
            </p>
            <div class="hero__cta">
              <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.whatsapp }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                <span>Join the WhatsApp group</span>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8"/></svg>
              </a>
              <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ site.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                <span>Follow on LinkedIn</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <ul class="hero__meta" aria-label="At a glance">
              <li><strong>Quarterly</strong> meetups</li>
              <li><strong>Campus</strong> sessions</li>
              <li><strong>Monthly</strong> casuals</li>
              <li><strong>No</strong> experience bar</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ===========================================================
           Our work — the four programmes we run, on repeat.
           -----------------------------------------------------------
           This row is deliberately FIXED at one card per
           programme, not one per event. Each card opens that
           programme's own page, where every event is logged, so the
           homepage never turns into a wall of tiles. The count and
           "latest" line on each card come from the programme's data
           file, so adding an event there updates the card too.
           =========================================================== -->
      <section class="section section--work reveal" id="work">
        <div class="container">
          <header class="section-head">
            <p class="comment-eyebrow">// ls ./programs</p>
            <h2 class="display">
              Less talk. Here's the <span class="ink">work</span>.
            </h2>
            <p class="lead">
              No roadmap theatre, no vague mission statements — four
              things we run on repeat, each with the full log of every
              one we've actually held. Talks for working developers,
              Swift taken onto campuses, a monthly brunch where nobody
              gives a talk at all, and an online hour on one topic.
            </p>
          </header>

          <div class="work-grid work-grid--programs">
            {%- for p in programmes %}
            {%- set c = p.data.card %}
            {%- set n = p.data.events.length %}
            <article class="work-card work-card--tall reveal-up" style="--i:{{ loop.index0 }}">
              <a class="work-card__link" href="{{ p.href }}">
                <span class="work-card__media work-card__media--{{ c.media }}">
                  <img src="{{ c.image.src }}" srcset="{{ c.image.srcset }}" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 92vw, 360px" alt="{{ c.image.alt }}" loading="lazy" />
                </span>
                <span class="work-card__body">
                  <span class="work-card__tag work-card__tag--{{ c.tagClass }}">{{ c.tag }}</span>
                  <span class="work-card__title">{{ c.title }}</span>
                  <span class="work-card__desc">
                    {{ c.desc }}
                  </span>
                  <span class="work-card__meta"><strong>{{ n }} {{ c.unit[0] if n == 1 else c.unit[1] }}</strong> · latest {{ p.data.events[0].date | monthYear }}</span>
                  <span class="work-card__cta">
                    {{ c.cta }}
                    {% arrow "next", 15 %}
                  </span>
                </span>
              </a>
            </article>
            {%- endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ===========================================================
           Core team — the eight who keep this going
           =========================================================== -->
      <section class="section section--team reveal" id="core-team">
        <div class="container">
          <header class="section-head section-head--center">
            <p class="comment-eyebrow">// core_team</p>
            <h2 class="display">
              The <span class="ink">core team</span>.
            </h2>
            <p class="lead">
              No titles between us, no permanent assignments. Different
              companies, different specialties, one shared instinct:
              whoever has a free weekend grabs whatever the next meetup
              needs, then hands it back when it's done. This month's
              venue scout is next month's name-tag printer. Who's bringing
              the projector adapter is, as always, a separate conversation.
            </p>
          </header>

          <div class="crew" role="list" aria-label="Core team members">
            <a class="crew__member" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/recursiveswift/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" role="listitem">
              <span class="crew__photo crew__photo--violet" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/CoreTeam/RimeshJotaniya.png" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
              <span class="crew__name">Rimesh Jotaniya</span>
            </a>
            <a class="crew__member" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/abhishekshinde1/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" role="listitem">
              <span class="crew__photo crew__photo--coral" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/CoreTeam/abhishek-shinde.jpeg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
              <span class="crew__name">Abhishek Shinde</span>
            </a>
            <a class="crew__member" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dezinezync/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" role="listitem">
              <span class="crew__photo crew__photo--orange" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/CoreTeam/nikhil-nigade.jpeg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
              <span class="crew__name">Nikhil Nigade</span>
            </a>
            <a class="crew__member" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/divya-maloo-72629284/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" role="listitem">
              <span class="crew__photo crew__photo--teal" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/CoreTeam/divya-maloo.jpeg" alt="" loading="lazy" style="transform: scale(2.3); transform-origin: 46% 6%;"></span>
              <span class="crew__name">Divya Maloo</span>
            </a>
            <a class="crew__member" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/swetal-matkar-73a836204/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" role="listitem">
              <span class="crew__photo crew__photo--green" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/CoreTeam/swetal-matkar.jpeg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
              <span class="crew__name">Swetal Matkar</span>
            </a>
            <a class="crew__member" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ganesh-patil-2b3431119/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" role="listitem">
              <span class="crew__photo crew__photo--coral" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/CoreTeam/ganesh-patil.jpeg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
              <span class="crew__name">Ganesh Patil</span>
            </a>
            <a class="crew__member" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/msusare/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" role="listitem">
              <span class="crew__photo crew__photo--blue" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/CoreTeam/mayur-susare.jpeg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
              <span class="crew__name">Mayur Susare</span>
            </a>
            <a class="crew__member" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/pareshkarnawat/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" role="listitem">
              <span class="crew__photo crew__photo--orange" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/CoreTeam/paresh-karnawat.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
              <span class="crew__name">Paresh Karnawat</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <p class="team__cta">
            Speaking is the fastest path to knowing everyone.
            <a class="link" href="{{ site.forms.pitchTalk }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              Pitch a talk via this form
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8"/></svg>
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ===========================================================
           Sponsors — how it works
           =========================================================== -->
      <section class="section section--sponsors reveal" id="sponsors">
        <div class="container">
          <header class="section-head section-head--center">
            <p class="comment-eyebrow">// sponsors</p>
            <h2 class="display">
              Supported by people who <span class="ink">care</span>.
            </h2>
            <p class="lead">
              Venues, food, name tags, the small AV bits — every meetup
              runs on someone's generosity. Hosts and sponsors get a stage
              minute at the event they back and a real thank-you from the
              room. {{ countWord }} {{ "company has" if hosts.length == 1 else "companies have" }} made it possible so far; the next
              slot should be yours.
            </p>
          </header>

          <aside class="sponsors-note" aria-label="A note from the SwiftPune crew">
            <header class="sponsors-note__head" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="sponsors-note__file">notes/to_future_hosts.swift</span>
            </header>
            <div class="sponsors-note__body">
              <p class="sponsors-note__line">A meetup needs almost nothing — a room for 75,</p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line">a projector, a few pots of coffee, three hours</p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line">of a weekend morning. We can't really sell</p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line">anyone on this. There's nothing to buy.</p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line sponsors-note__line--blank"></p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line">Past hosts have offered what they already had:</p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line">the conference room that was empty that morning,</p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line">the coffee budget no one was watching. The</p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line">talks were ours; the chairs were theirs.</p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line">That was the whole deal.</p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line sponsors-note__line--blank"></p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line">If you'd like to make a morning happen, write</p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line">to us. We'll shape it around whatever you can</p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line">offer. No tier list. No deck. No ask beyond</p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line">the room.</p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line sponsors-note__line--blank"></p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line sponsors-note__line--sign">— the SwiftPune crew</p>
              <p class="sponsors-note__line"><a class="link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
            </div>
          </aside>

          <div class="hosts-log" aria-label="Hosts so far">
            <p class="hosts-log__eyebrow">// hosts.history</p>
            <ol class="hosts-log__list">
              {%- for e in hosts %}
              <li class="hosts-log__item">
                <span class="hosts-log__sid">{{ e.key }}</span>
                <span class="hosts-log__name">{{ e.host }}</span>
              </li>
              {%- endfor %}
              <li class="hosts-log__item hosts-log__item--open">
                <span class="hosts-log__sid">{{ meetups.events[0].key | nextKey }}</span>
                <span class="hosts-log__name">your company?</span>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <p class="sponsors__cta">
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Host%20SwiftPune%20at%20our%20company">
              <span>Host SwiftPune at your company</span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
